bench-test-stream-triad-about = Multiplies one block, adds another, and stores the sum, by the STREAM method. The usual single figure for memory speed.

bench-verdict-okay = An entry-level computer. It copes with browsing, documents, and video calls, and will feel slow with heavy work.

